    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Uses high-quality, high-elasticity carbon prepreg</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Anglers say it's light when they hold it</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Lightweight design with balanced technology and a cast that gives a good feeling of swinging, providing maximum rod performance.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Guide</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Mainly uses titanium frame K series guides</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Sharp casts and increased distance.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Guide setting considering the texture and action of the blank</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Double lock nut seat</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Double nut system with special anti-rust paint finish</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Back stop mechanism is used to minimize loosening.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The butt cap is made of BRC</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Total length (m): 3.04</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Number of joints (pieces): 2</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Weight (g): 394</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Lure Jig: 80-150</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Lure Piug&plusmn;20g: 100</span></p>